BT /F1 9.3 Tf 0.13 0.16 0.20 rg 50 257.5 Td (gives 21 times 3, which equals 63 values. For two hands, 63 times 2 equals 126 values.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 0.13 0.16 0.20 rg 50 245 Td (That is the static feature vector used by the two-hand prediction pathway.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 0.13 0.16 0.20 rg 50 227.5 Td (Write: 2 hands x 21 landmarks x 3 coordinates = 126 values.) Tj ET
